~ beginning
do CutsceneManager.player_face("right")
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(3528.0,500), 0.75, 1, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Fenn: The [color="0B4F4A"]Great Hall[/color] should be up ahead...
Fenn starry: I can't believe [i][color="B80006"]King Oakley[/color][/i] invited me himself!
Fenn starry: [font_size=60][wave freq=8 amp=30]I can't wait to meet all the Knights![/wave][/font_size]
do EventFlags.set_flag("0-None-Beginning", true)
=> END


~ prehall
do CutsceneManager.player_face("right")
do! MusicManager._fade_out()
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(10588.0,500), 0.75, 1, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Fenn: [font_size=40][i]phew[/i]. Okay, here we go...[/font_size]
???: HEY! [wait=0.3]STOP THIS AT ONCE!!
#???: RELEASE US!
#??? door: [font_size=80]HAH![wait=0.3] [shake level=8 rate=40]What's wrong?[/shake] [/font_size]
#??? door: [font_size=70][wave freq=7 amp=30]A little taste of your own [i]medicine?[/i][/wave][/font_size]
#??? door: Now, my men! [wait=0.3][shake level=7 rate=30]SCATTER![/shake]
Fenn worry: What the heck?
do! MusicManager._fade_in()
do EventFlags.set_flag("0-None-PreHall", true)
=> END